---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="Privacy Policy - bneuhausz.dev" canonical="https://bneuhausz.dev/privacy">
  <section class="prose dark:prose-invert text-left max-w-screen-xl mx-auto px-8 pb-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl m-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>
      This site is my personal blog and it collects very limited data. This page explains what data is collected, how it is used, and how it is handled.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl m-2">Website Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      I use Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand aggregate, anonymous traffic patterns. It is
      privacy-focused: it does not use cookies and does not collect any personally identifiable
      information (PII). I rely on it only to see how the site is used so I can improve it.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl m-2">Newsletter</h2>
    <p>
      If you subscribe to the newsletter, I collect your email address so I can send you updates
      about new posts and related content. I use MailerLite to manage the subscriber list and send
      these emails, so your address is stored on MailerLite's servers. You can review
      <a href="https://www.mailerlite.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MailerLite's privacy policy</a>
      for details on how they handle your data. You can unsubscribe at any time using the link in
      the footer of every email.
    </p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
